@startstorymap
title A bookshop online
release MVP : sell the first book
release Spring : people come back
release Later
activity Find a book
  step Search
    * By title : MVP
    * By author : MVP
    * By what it is about : Spring
  step Browse
    * The new books : MVP
    * By topic : Spring
    * What others bought too : Later
activity Choose
  step Read about it
    * A page of its own : MVP
    * A look inside : Later
  step Keep it for later
    * A wish list : Spring
activity Buy
  step Basket
    * Put it in the basket : MVP
    * Change how many : MVP
  step Pay
    * By card : MVP
    * By invoice : Spring
    * With a gift card
activity Get it
  step Delivery
    * Track the parcel : Spring
    * Send it back : Later
